  m_text: 'A signal alarm from the enemy base made the squad fall back and looked
    for escape.


    Arya and his unit got separated from the others when he got
    out of the enemy base. He found himself in an abandon city where the enemies
    doing their patrol.


    Arya has to look for a way to get out of the city and
    back to his squad.'
